on=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca aria-haspopup=\u0022dialog\u0022 aria-label=\u0022Open image\u0022 data-gallery=\u0022galleryname_26da2ddc-1f9a-4bab-add9-7d6aa5fa5b91\u0022 data-toggle=\u0022lightbox\u0022 data-type=\u0022image\u0022 href=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/lc3lfkac/3chillies-crystal-maze-picture.jpg\u0022 role=\u0022button\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/lc3lfkac/3chillies-crystal-maze-picture.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0780e5c45590\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/lc3lfkac/3chillies-crystal-maze-picture.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0780e5c45590\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022An image of the 3Chillies team at the Crystal Maze visitor attraction in London\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/lc3lfkac/3chillies-crystal-maze-picture.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0780e5c45590\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/lc3lfkac/3chillies-crystal-maze-picture.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0780e5c45590\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/lc3lfkac/3chillies-crystal-maze-picture.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0780e5c45590\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_breadcrumb base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022breadcrumb-trail\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_text base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELast week we had a great 3chillies company away day in London.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMany of us work remotely now with some staff living as far afield as Leeds, Torbay, South Wales and Bristol. The away day was a welcome opportunity to get together in person as a team, catch up with each other, and even meet some colleagues face to face for the first time.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe spent the morning taking stock of how the year has gone so far and what we have planned going into 2025. It\u0027s been a good year for 3chillies with us winning new work and delivering some major projects, and we\u0027re looking forward to this continuing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith the working part of the day out of the way, the afternoon was spent at The Crystal Maze Live Experience in central London. This is based on the legendary nineties TV show where players take on various physical and mental challenges.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe split into smaller teams and enjoyed a bit of healthy competition. Some of us turned out to be unexpectedly competitive!\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe whole day was brilliant . It was a much enjoyed break from our usual routine that was an excellent boost to company morale and a chance to bond with colleagues in person.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component meta base-bg\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E11 Oct 2024\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/events/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Events\u0022\u003EEvents\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Author Bio --\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component author-bio base-bg\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item_text-left\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- Info --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022secondary-heading base-secondary-heading sm\u0022\u003EAbout the author\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading base-heading sm\u0022\u003E\r\n3chillies                        \u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- Social --\u003E\n\n\u003C!--// Social --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Info --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C!--// Author Bio --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Content column --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Second column --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022right-col col-xl-3 col-lg-4 col-12 order-2\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- SUB - FILTER --\u003E\n\n\u003C!--// SUB --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Second column --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_ctastrip c1-bg c1-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022container\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- ROW --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022row justify-content-between align-items-center textAlignmentLeft\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022secondary-heading lg c1-secondary-heading os-animation\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221s\u0022\u003EUnlimited possibilities\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading lg c1-heading os-animation\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221s\u0022\u003E3chillies\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text c1-text os-animation\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022intro lg\u0022\u003EGet in touch today\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022link os-animation\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca class=\u0022btn boxed-btn btn-lg c2-btn-bg c2-btn-bg-solid c2-btn-bg-hover-solid c2-btn-text c2-btn-borders\u0022 href=\u0022http://www.3chillies.co.uk/newsletter-sign-up/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cspan\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\r\n                                Newsletter sign Up\r\n                            \u003C/a\u003E\n\u003Ca class=\u0022btn boxed-btn btn-lg base-btn-bg base-btn-bg-solid base-btn-bg-hover base-btn-bg-hover-solid base-btn-text base-btn-borders\u0022 href=\u0022http://www.3chillies.co.uk/contact/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cspan\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\r\n                                Contact us\r\n                            \u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// ROW --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C/main\u003E\n\u003C!--// Content --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Footer --\u003E\n\n\u003C!--// Footer --\u003E"
          }
        }
